
---
import Layout from "../layouts/Page.astro";
import PageContent from "../components/PageContent.astro";
---

<Layout>
<PageContent>
  <main class="about-page">
    <a href="/" class="back-link">← back home</a>

    <h1>about</h1>

    <section>
      <h2>a bit about me</h2>

      <p>
        student/writer/researcher/organizer
      </p>

      <p>
        a lot of my work circles around the same questions: 
        how do we care for one another,
        who gets cared for, how do we find enough care within to carve out lives for ourselves?
      </p>

      <p>
        outside of that, i love coding, body horror,
    queer histories, niche defunct webseries', and pokemon. 
      </p>
    </section>


<section>
  <h2>why ill mutual?</h2>

  <p>
    i originally chose ill mutual as the name of my substack,
    and carried it over to this website. i'm chronically ill
    and a community organizer. the name is a play on
    both of those things.
  </p>

  <p>
    i like the different meanings of mutual: mutual aid,
    mutual dependence, mutual understanding. rage against 
    this idea of not owing anyone anything. i owe everyone 
    everything.
  </p>

  <p>
    this site is somewhere to keep my writing, research,
    coding projects, and whatever else i want to put
    into the world.
  </p>
</section>



<section class="elsewhere">
  <h2>elsewhere on the internet</h2>

  <p>
    other places you can find me:
  </p>

  <div class="social-links">
    <a
       <a href="https://www.tumblr.com/theslobgob69">tumblr ↗</a>
       <a href="https:illmutual.substack.com">substack ↗</a>
    </a>
  </div>

  
</section>

  </main>
  </PageContent>
</Layout>

<style>

.social-links {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.75rem;
}

.social-links a {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
  background: #dce5d1;
  border: 1px solid #526b45;
  color: #263d2d;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-family: monospace;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
}

.social-links a:hover {
  background: #526b45;
  color: #f0f2e8;
}

.social-links a:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid #263d2d;
  outline-offset: 3px;
}


  h1 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: normal;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #526b45;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  section {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .back-link {
    color: #526b45;
  }
</style>
